    <briefdescription>
<para>This class presents a data sink to which the Telemetry framework sends data. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Its implementation is transparent to the framework. It is up to the vendor to decide which pieces of data to forward and where to forward them. </para>
